---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { u } from '../lib/sections';
---
<Base title="About" description="About David (Dexter) Kamau: strategic communications professional, community builder, writer and runner based in Nairobi.">
  <div class="wrap sec" style="padding-top:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="n">08</span><h1 class="page-title">About</h1></div>
    <div class="split">
      <div style="flex:2 1 480px; max-width:720px; font-size:18px">
        <h2 class="eyebrow">Short bio</h2>
        <p style="margin-top:12px">David (Dexter) Kamau is a strategic communications professional based in Nairobi. He is Marketing and Communications Officer at CIB Kenya Limited, where he has worked since August 2023. He has chaired RYLA Kenya, chartered Rotaract Club of Jabali, served on Rotary International's Youth Advisory Council, and hosts events and moderates panels. He writes for Fragments of Insights and runs and hikes in his spare time.</p>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Draft for your edit. Use this length for event introductions and professional profiles.</p>

        <h2 class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:40px">Education and languages</h2>
        <p style="margin-top:12px">Bachelor of Technology in Office Administration and Technology, The Technical University of Kenya. English, Kiswahili (native) and conversational French. Currently learning Kenyan Sign Language.</p>

        <h2 class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:40px">Still to write</h2>
        <p style="margin-top:12px">A medium professional bio, an extended personal biography, and a short statement of how you think about communication. These should come from you in conversation rather than from a template, so tell me the story and I will shape it.</p>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">To confirm: your Kiswahili and French levels as you want them shown, and the dates for your degree.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="photo" style="flex:0 1 380px; min-width:240px">
        <img src={u('/images/portrait.jpg')} alt="David Kamau smiling with arms folded on an athletics track, wearing a black and pink running jacket" style="aspect-ratio:2/3" />
        <figcaption>Photographer to supply.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
